","x":1660,"y":1015,"width":70,"height":39}]},{"text":"은 시스템마다 크게 다르다. 일부 시스템은 메가바이트 미만의 공간을 자지하고 전체 화","words":[{"text":"은","x":334,"y":1080,"width":37,"height":38},{"text":"시스템마다","x":385,"y":1079,"width":172,"height":40},{"text":"크게","x":568,"y":1079,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"다르다.","x":651,"y":1079,"width":109,"height":40},{"text":"일부","x":779,"y":1078,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"시스템은","x":859,"y":1079,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"메가바이트","x":1012,"y":1081,"width":177,"height":40},{"text":"미만의","x":1204,"y":1082,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"공간을","x":1323,"y":1082,"width":111,"height":40},{"text":"자지하고","x":1447,"y":1082,"width":147,"height":40},{"text":"전체","x":1610,"y":1081,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"화","x":1694,"y":1082,"width":36,"height":39}]},{"text":"면 편집기가 없는 반면, 다른 시스템은 기가바이트의 공간이 필요하며 그래픽 원도 시스","words":[{"text":"면","x":337,"y":1146,"width":31,"height":37},{"text":"편집기가","x":384,"y":1146,"width":138,"height":40},{"text":"없는","x":537,"y":1146,"width":66,"height":39},{"text":"반면,","x":616,"y":1146,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"다른","x":707,"y":1145,"width":68,"height":40},{"text":"시스템은","x":788,"y":1145,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"기가바이트의","x":942,"y":1147,"width":207,"height":41},{"text":"공간이","x":1165,"y":1149,"width":103,"height":39},{"text":"필요하며","x":1288,"y":1149,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"그래픽","x":1447,"y":1148,"width":105,"height":40},{"text":"원도","x":1572,"y":1148,"width":72,"height":38},{"text":"시스","x":1659,"y":1147,"width":70,"height":40}]},{"text":"템을 기반으로 한다. 더욱 일반적인 정의와 우리가 지지하는 것은 운영체제가 컴퓨터에","words":[{"text":"템을","x":336,"y":1212,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"기반으로","x":419,"y":1213,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":569,"y":1213,"width":76,"height":40},{"text":"더욱","x":664,"y":1212,"width":67,"height":40},{"text":"일반적인","x":747,"y":1212,"width":135,"height":40},{"text":"정의와","x":899,"y":1213,"width":106,"height":42},{"text":"우리가","x":1017,"y":1215,"width":109,"height":39},{"text":"지지하는","